WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,290 --> 00:00:03,690
Why are you so stupid?

2
00:00:03,690 --> 00:00:04,990
Now Yuqing is unhappy

3
00:00:04,990 --> 00:00:08,090
Do you know how serious the problem is? As long as you have a good attitude

4
00:00:08,090 --> 00:00:09,390
He will definitely forgive you

5
00:00:09,390 --> 00:00:10,890
White lotus with green tea

6
00:00:10,890 --> 00:00:11,890
Too lazy to act with you

7
00:00:11,890 --> 00:00:13,350
What's wrong

8
00:00:13,350 --> 00:00:15,570
I didn't do anything bad either.

9
00:00:15,570 --> 00:00:16,870
Are you stupid?

10
00:00:16,870 --> 00:00:17,970
Now the city is closed due to heavy snow

11
00:00:17,970 --> 00:00:19,570
Our family is almost running out of food.

12
00:00:19,570 --> 00:00:21,070
Now you can send me some steak and lobster.

13
00:00:21,070 --> 00:00:22,970
It just shows loyalty. Yuqing is moved.

14
00:00:22,970 --> 00:00:24,270
Don't you have a chance?

15
00:00:24,270 --> 00:00:26,470
But I have just enough supplies at home to feed myself

16
00:00:26,470 --> 00:00:27,670
Nothing extra

17
00:00:27,670 --> 00:00:28,970
Why are you so confused?

18
00:00:28,970 --> 00:00:30,270
What's wrong with two hungry meals?

19
00:00:30,270 --> 00:00:32,370
Red hair, rain and clear weather are no better than anything else

20
00:00:32,370 --> 00:00:34,270
It can be seen that I can’t even bear to eat.

21
00:00:34,270 --> 00:00:35,770
You don't really like her at all

22
00:00:37,070 --> 00:00:38,870
What does an O mean?

23
00:00:38,870 --> 00:00:39,970
I told you so much

24
00:00:39,970 --> 00:00:41,470
Just get this attitude

25
00:00:41,470 --> 00:00:42,770
Send the food over quickly

26
00:00:42,770 --> 00:00:44,860
I also want to eat Oron steak

27
00:00:44,860 --> 00:00:46,460
Doesn't he dislike you?
